# Enterprise RAG Agent

Built an AI Agent that answers questions from enterprise documents using RAG, LangChain, and Vector DB.

## Features
- RAG Pipeline - PDF -> Embeddings -> Semantic Search
- AI Agent with Planning, Memory, Tool Use, Execution Loops
- Vector Database - ChromaDB
- FastAPI Backend + Streamlit UI
- Handles Retail, Finance, Sales enterprise data

## Tech Stack
Python, LangChain, ChromaDB, HuggingFace, Streamlit, FastAPI

## How to Run
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
